[gd_scene load_steps=31 format=3]

; zone_ridge — the greybox stand-in for the ridge (WLD-05 replaces the layout).
;
; Deliberately awkward: pillars that force corner-cutting, a narrow gap that tests whether
; the agent radius is right, and a wall to path around. A flat empty plane would make any
; movement code feel fine and prove nothing.
;
; Population is no longer placed here. Three spawn fields name their tuning in
; game/data/zones/act1.json and this scene supplies only their positions, which is the split
; the whole zone system is built on: data says what and how many, the scene says where.

